ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Jing and Li Qiang are lovers in college, they are dating for two years, both are from wealthy families. On Zhang Jing's birthday, after consulting all of Zhang Jing's friends, Li Qiang prepares a surprise party for her and invites all her good friends.\n\n[Question]\nZhang Jing should be very happy at the party, but she is very worried, why is this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. They are at the point of discussing marriage, she worries whether Li Qiang is her real \"Mr. Right\".\nB. Zhang Jing worries that Li Qiang spends too much money on the party, she does not want him to have any financial pressure.\nC. Zhang Jing worries that her friends may not like the party that Li Qiang prepares.\nD. Zhang Jing worries that Li Qiang may leave the party halfway because of work, which makes her unhappy.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725550558006276,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e099d6006945d27fc814","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367641638,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"de862243cbd84aefb8e2a6ed711aa980"}